Grief stance: denial — counts the dead in her ledger so she never has to feel them.
One name is missing: her brother Samir. Dry humour. Hub: merchant; buys KEPT memories.
Lost one: her husband, the caravan master [TBD name]. Samir's shade never comes to her door (he is alive).
